stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NOT_STARTED
    
    NOT_STARTED --> IN_PROGRESS : start()
    
    IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : complete(score >= passing)
    IN_PROGRESS --> FAILED : complete(score < passing)
    IN_PROGRESS --> FAILED : fail()
    
    COMPLETED --> EXPIRED : expire()
    COMPLETED --> EXPIRED : isExpired() == true
    
    FAILED --> IN_PROGRESS : start() [attempts < maxAttempts]
    EXPIRED --> IN_PROGRESS : start() [attempts < maxAttempts]
    
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*] : [attempts >= maxAttempts]
    EXPIRED --> [*] : [attempts >= maxAttempts]
